### ==============================================================================
### IEEE MENOUFIA STUDENT BRANCH PORTAL - COMPLETE MANUAL FLOWS TEST SUITE
### ==============================================================================
### Use VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client) or IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### Sequential variables (@name) automatically propagate IDs & JWT tokens between requests.
### ==============================================================================

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:4000
@coreUrl = http://localhost:5070
@eventUrl = http://localhost:5050
@emailUrl = http://localhost:3060
@fileUrl = http://localhost:5080

@aiCommitteeId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@hrCommitteeId = 32323232-3232-4323-8323-323232323232
@prCommitteeId = 55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555
@mediaCommitteeId = 66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 1: Health & Connectivity Probes
### ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Gateway Service Health
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/health

### 1.2 Core Platform Service Health
GET {{coreUrl}}/health

### 1.3 Event Register Service Health
GET {{eventUrl}}/api/v1/health

### 1.4 Email Service Health
GET {{emailUrl}}/health

### 1.5 File Service Health
GET {{fileUrl}}/health


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 2: Authentication, Context Switching & Token Lifecycle
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Register a New Volunteer
# @name registerUser
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "karim.volunteer@ieee.local",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Karim Volunteer"
}

### 2.2 Login as Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ieee.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.3 Login as AI Committee Lead
# @name loginLeadAi
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lead.ai@ieee.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.4 Login as AI Committee Member
# @name loginMemberAi
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member.ai@ieee.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.5 Login as Applicant
# @name loginApplicant
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "applicant@ieee.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.6 Check Current Identity Profile (Admin)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 2.7 Switch Active Context/Role (AI Member switches scope by targetScopeId)
# @name switchContext
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/switch-context
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetScopeId": "{{aiCommitteeId}}"
}

### 2.8 Refresh Token Rotation (Issues new token pair and rotates refresh token)
# @name refreshToken
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 2.9 Revoke Session & Logout
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 3: Public Catalog Discovery (Visitor / Public)
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1 List All Public Committees
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/public/committees

### 3.2 List Public Published Announcements
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/public/announcements

### 3.3 List Public Published Media Albums
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/public/media/albums


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 4: Committee Workspace & Task Lifecycle
### ==============================================================================

### 4.1 Lead Views AI Committee Workspace
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/workspace
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}

### 4.2 Lead Assigns Task to Committee Member
# @name createTask
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Develop Computer Vision Pipeline Demo",
  "description": "Implement YOLOv8 object detection model for the upcoming robotics showcase.",
  "assigneeUserId": "member-ai-1",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00.000Z"
}

### 4.3 Member Checks Personal Dashboard
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}

### 4.4 Member Updates Task Status: todo -> in_progress
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.task.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 4.5 Member Completes Task: in_progress -> done
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.task.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### 4.6 Lead Uploads Committee Learning Resource Document
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Computer Vision & PyTorch Starter Guide",
  "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/v1/ieee_portal/resources/cv_guide.pdf",
  "resourceType": "document"
}

### 4.7 Lead Posts Internal Committee Announcement (With Image Attachment)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Weekly Committee Sync Meeting",
  "body": "Join us this Friday at 6:00 PM on Google Meet for project sprint reviews.",
  "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/ieee_portal/announcements/sync-banner.jpg",
  "caption": "Project Sprint Review Agenda"
}

### 4.8 Committee Members View Internal Announcements
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 5: HR Recruitment Campaign & Onboarding Pipeline
### ==============================================================================

### 5.1 Admin Creates Recruitment Campaign
# @name createCampaign
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "committeeId": "{{aiCommitteeId}}",
  "title": "Annual IEEE AI Committee Recruitment 2026",
  "targetHeadcount": 15,
  "opensAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "closesAt": "2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "status": "open"
}

### 5.2 Applicant Submits Application
# @name submitApplication
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{loginApplicant.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": "{{createCampaign.response.body.campaign.id}}",
  "committeeId": "{{aiCommitteeId}}",
  "answers": {
    "fullName": "Karim Volunteer",
    "universityMajor": "Computer Science & Artificial Intelligence",
    "academicYear": "3rd Year",
    "motivation": "Eager to contribute to IEEE open-source machine learning workshops."
  },
  "resumeUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/v1/ieee_portal/resumes/karim_cv.pdf"
}

### 5.3 HR Lead Transitions Stage: applied -> screening
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications/{{submitApplication.response.body.application.id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "screening",
  "notes": "Strong background in Python and neural network basics."
}

### 5.4 HR Lead Transitions Stage: screening -> interview
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications/{{submitApplication.response.body.application.id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "interview",
  "notes": "Technical interview scheduled for Wednesday 4:00 PM."
}

### 5.5 HR Lead Transitions Stage: interview -> final_review
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications/{{submitApplication.response.body.application.id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "final_review",
  "notes": "Passed technical interview with high score."
}

### 5.6 HR Lead Accepts Applicant (Syncs Role to IAM Gateway)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications/{{submitApplication.response.body.application.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Welcome to IEEE Menoufia AI Committee!"
}

### 5.7 Accepted Member Updates Onboarding Checklist
# @name listOnboarding
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/onboarding/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginApplicant.response.body.token}}

### 5.8 Member Marks Onboarding Item Done
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/onboarding/items/{{listOnboarding.response.body.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginApplicant.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 6: PR Broadcast & Media Operations
### ==============================================================================

### 6.1 Media Lead Requests Upload Signature (Auto Credit-Saving Transforms)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/files/signature
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "folder": "ieee_portal/media_albums",
  "tags": ["media", "robotics", "2026"]
}

### 6.2 Media Lead Creates Draft Media Album
# @name createAlbum
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/albums
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "committeeId": "{{aiCommitteeId}}",
  "title": "IEEE AI & Robotics Live Expo 2026",
  "description": "Comprehensive photo gallery covering autonomous robotics trials and AI exhibitions."
}

### 6.3 Attach Relational Photo Asset to Album
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.album.id}}/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/ieee_portal/media_albums/robotics-01.jpg",
  "assetType": "image",
  "caption": "Autonomous navigation trial run on obstacle course"
}

### 6.4 Attach Second Photo Asset to Album
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.album.id}}/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/ieee_portal/media_albums/robotics-02.jpg",
  "assetType": "image",
  "caption": "Participants training deep neural networks"
}

### 6.5 Media Lead Publishes Album to Public Gallery
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.album.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 6.6 Public Views Published Album and Its Assets
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/public/media/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.album.id}}/assets


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 7: Member Avatar Management
### ==============================================================================

### 7.1 Request Avatar Upload Signature (Face Detection Crop)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/files/signature
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "folder": "ieee_portal/avatars"
}

### 7.2 Update User Profile Avatar URL
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "avatarUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,w_400,h_400,g_face/ieee_portal/avatars/member-avatar.jpg"
}

### 7.3 Verify Updated Avatar on Dashboard
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 8: Event Registration & Scanner Check-in
### ==============================================================================

### 8.1 Create Tech Summit Event
# @name createEvent
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Menoufia Tech Summit 2026",
  "description": "Annual flagship engineering and computing conference",
  "date": "2026-09-20T09:00:00.000Z",
  "location": "Main University Auditorium",
  "bannerUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/ieee_portal/events/summit-banner.jpg"
}

### 8.2 Create Activity Check-In Point
# @name createActivity
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.event._id}}/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Main Hall Entrance Check-In",
  "type": "Check-In"
}

### 8.3 Register Participant for Event
# @name registerParticipant
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.event._id}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sara Youssef",
  "email": "sara.youssef@ieee.local",
  "phone": "+201001234567"
}

### 8.4 Scanner Check-in via Activity QR
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.event._id}}/qr/scan
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketId": "{{registerParticipant.response.body.participant._id}}",
  "activityQrId": "{{createActivity.response.body.activity.qrId}}"
}

### 8.5 View Event Attendance Report
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.event._id}}/attendance/report
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 8.6 Export Attendance CSV
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.event._id}}/attendance/export
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}


