### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 10: Security, Negative Assertions & Attack Defense
### ==============================================================================

### 10.1 Rejects Bad Password Credentials (Expects 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ieee.local",
  "password": "wrong-password-attack"
}

### 10.2 Rejects Unauthorized Context Switching (Expects 403 Forbidden)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/switch-context
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetScopeId": "99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999"
}

### 10.3 Detects Refresh Token Replay & Revokes Family (Expects 403 Forbidden)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 10.4 Empty Media Album Publish Guard (Expects 400 Bad Request)
# @name createEmptyAlbum
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/albums
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "committeeId": "{{aiCommitteeId}}",
  "title": "Empty Album Test",
  "description": "Should fail to publish without photos"
}

### 10.5 Attempt Publish of Empty Album (Expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/albums/{{createEmptyAlbum.response.body.album.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 10.6 Non-Admin Blocked from Admin Role Assignment (Expects 401/403)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/admin/roles/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "member-ai-1",
  "role": "admin",
  "scopeType": "global",
  "scopeId": "global"
}

### 10.7 Unauthenticated Request Blocked from Committee Workspace (Expects 401)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/workspace

### 10.8 Applicant Blocked from Restricted Media Folder Upload (Expects 403 Forbidden)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/files/signature
Authorization: Bearer {{loginApplicant.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "folder": "ieee_portal/media_albums"
}
